      <title>索尼微软任天堂一致表态：关税退款无义务返还玩家</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E7%B4%A2%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%BB%E5%A4%A9%E5%A0%82%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E8%A1%A8%E6%80%81%E5%85%B3%E7%A8%8E%E9%80%80%E6%AC%BE%E6%97%A0%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%A1%E8%BF%94%E8%BF%98%E7%8E%A9%E5%AE%B6/</link>
